---
import LegalLayout from '@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { ORG } from '@/lib/schema/entity';
const url = '/terms/';
const title = 'Website Terms and Conditions | Scaling Socials Media';
const description =
  'The terms and conditions governing use of the Scaling Socials website and the services provided by Scaling Socials Media LLP, Bengaluru, India.';
const intro =
  'The following terms and conditions, privacy policy and cookie policy cover services provided by Scaling Socials. If you continue to browse and use this website, you agree to comply with and be bound by them.';
const toc = [
  { id: 'information', title: '1. Information and disclaimers' },
  { id: 'pricing-policy', title: '2. Pricing policy' },
  { id: 'refund', title: '3. Refund policy' },
  { id: 'rights', title: '4. Rights' },
  { id: 'other-websites', title: '5. Other websites' },
  { id: 'pricing', title: '6. Pricing' },
  { id: 'complaints', title: '7. Queries and complaints' },
  { id: 'copyright', title: '8. Copyright notice' },
  { id: 'cookies', title: '9. Cookie policy' },
];
---
<LegalLayout url={url} title={title} description={description} heading="Terms and Conditions" updated="4 September 2026" intro={intro} toc={toc}>
  <p>If you disagree with any part of these terms and conditions, please do not use the website.</p>

  <h2 id="information">1. Information and Disclaimers</h2>
  <p>Whilst Scaling Socials works hard to prevent any or all errors and omissions, neither we nor any third parties provide any warranty or guarantee as to the accuracy, performance or completeness of information offered on this website for any particular purpose or use.</p>
  <p>The material on this website is owned by or licensed to Scaling Socials and includes, but is not limited to, the design, layout, look, appearance and graphics. Reproduction of all material is prohibited other than in accordance with the copyright notice and with permission given.</p>
  <p>Scaling Socials will not be held liable in connection to the website, products or services offered both by us or others. This includes direct, indirect or consequential losses. We are not liable for any financial losses caused as a result of using the website.</p>
  <p>By accepting these terms and conditions you accept that Scaling Socials is not responsible for the welfare of its clients or students.</p>

  <h2 id="pricing-policy">2. Pricing Policy</h2>
  <p>Our company usually prices services based on the client requirement. To gather the requirements we do our initial discovery call where we determine the requirement and price accordingly.</p>

  <h2 id="refund">3. Refund Policy</h2>
  <p>At Scaling Socials, we follow a strict no-refund policy. Once a service has been purchased, no refunds will be issued under any circumstances. We encourage clients to review our offerings carefully before proceeding with any transaction. For any concerns, our support team is always here to assist you.</p>

  <h2 id="rights">4. Rights</h2>
  <p>Scaling Socials reserves the right to change or alter any part of the website, with or without notice, both temporarily and permanently. We always work to maintain the website at all times, however, it is subject to change.</p>

  <h2 id="other-websites">5. Other Websites</h2>
  <p>This website may also include links to other websites or applications. These links are provided for the user’s convenience to give further information. They do not signify that Scaling Socials agree or endorse them and are not liable for their content.</p>

  <h2 id="pricing">6. Pricing</h2>
  <p>Payments between Scaling Socials and the users are handled by Stripe, Inc. and PayPal. All prices for Scaling Socials services are correct at the time of writing and are subject to change at any time before an agreement is made; once an agreement is made between Scaling Socials and a user the price is fixed unless stated. All prices are exclusive of tax. The user has the right to cancel a subscription at any time.</p>
  <p>Although we try to ensure all prices are correct at all times, there may be an occasion when something is priced incorrectly; we will verify the cost at the point of payment. If you cancel your membership, you will not receive a refund but will be able to access all features until the month expires. There is no obligation to continue your membership. You have the right to cancel at any time.</p>
  <p>Consultation calls will be paid for in advance; if no payment is received before the indicated time slot the consultation will not go ahead. Scaling Socials have the right to cancel consultation calls without notice. If this happens due to a scheduling error on Scaling Socials’ part then the cost of the call will be refunded to the user. If the user misses their scheduled time slot they will not be able to rebook for free. If you are running late you must let the member of Scaling Socials hosting the call know as soon as possible. If there is a ‘no show’ the appointment will be cancelled after 50% of the time has elapsed, and no refund shall be given.</p>

  <h2 id="complaints">7. Queries and Complaints</h2>
  <p>Scaling Socials always aims to provide an excellent and professional service. If you are unhappy with a service or would like to provide feedback, please email us at <a href={`mailto:${ORG.email}`}>{ORG.email}</a>.</p>

  <h2 id="copyright">8. Copyright Notice</h2>
  <p>This application and its content are copyright of Scaling Socials.</p>
  <p>All information on this website is protected by copyright and belongs to Scaling Socials. The copying and reproduction of any material used for this website, in any media or format of any kind, is strictly prohibited unless written permission by Scaling Socials is obtained prior to use. This is true for content and information.</p>

  <h2 id="cookies">9. Cookie Policy</h2>
  <p>Scaling Socials uses cookies to enhance your browsing experience. Cookies are small files stored on your computer’s hard drive and allow websites to respond to you as a specific user; this allows your preferences to be remembered.</p>
  <p>Whilst some browsers will only allow you to reject third-party cookies, most browsers allow you to reject all cookies. A negative impact of blocking all cookies, however, is that it will have a negative impact on the usability of many websites. See our <a href="/cookie-policy/">cookie policy</a> and <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a> for more.</p>
</LegalLayout>
